5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, friends. Let us begin this journey with open hearts and clear minds.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,I am Minako. I will observe carefully and rely on logic. Let us stay calm and find the truth together.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I am George. I have seen many things in my life. I will observe quietly and trust my own judgment.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I am Asuka. I will rely on logic and careful observation. Let us proceed without unnecessary emotion.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura! I love mysteries and pranks. Let's have fun and find the wolf together!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,I appreciate your introductions. Let us listen to one another with patience. Who feels most comfortable sharing their initial thoughts?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,I will keep my observations private for now. Let us listen to everyone else first before forming any judgments.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,I will not rush to conclusions. Let us see how the night reveals itself. Patience is a virtue.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. Premature accusations are counterproductive. Let us gather data before acting.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I agree! Let's stay friendly and watch for clues. I'm ready for the mystery!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,I find it fascinating how we all seek truth in different ways. Let us remain open and kind to one another.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us maintain composure. The night will bring information. We must be ready to act decisively when the time comes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,I concur. Silence is often more revealing than words. Let us rest and let the night speak for itself.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I concur. Rest is necessary. We will analyze the data tomorrow. Goodnight.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Goodnight! I hope we catch the wolf tomorrow. Sweet dreams, everyone!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"A peaceful night brings clarity. Let us rest well and wake with renewed purpose. Goodnight, friends.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,Goodnight. I will process the information gathered today. Let us rest and prepare for tomorrow's discussion.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,"Goodnight. I will reflect on what I have seen. Rest well, everyone.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
