31,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. The night has passed. I trust we all slept well. Let us begin our discussion with calm and open minds.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,Good morning. I have information from the night that is crucial for our safety. I will share it now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"I am listening. Please share what you have learned. We must act on solid ground, not speculation.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am listening. Please state your findings clearly. We need concrete evidence to proceed, not vague hints.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Morning! I'm so excited to hear the news! Please tell us who the wolf is!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I am curious about the nature of this information. Is it a confirmation of safety, or a warning? Please share it clearly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,George is human. I have confirmed his safety through my divination. We can focus our suspicion on the remaining players.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"I am honored by your trust, Minako. I will use this knowledge to protect the village. Let us examine the others closely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
